(a) Be it further enacted, that the Mayor shall:
(1) Preside at meetings of the Council and set the Agenda therefor after receiving input from members of the City Council, the City Manager and the public;
(2) Have a vote only in the case of a tie vote by Councilmembers, but shall not have veto power;
